  "published": "2026-10-29T13:06:44.453Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.1: deterministic group parallelism. MaxDegreeOfParallelism (default -1, all cores; 1 = single-threaded) on JxlEncoderOptions and JxlTranscoderOptions; decoding uses the core DecoderOptions.MaxDegreeOfParallelism. Encoded bytes, decoded pixels, metadata edits, reconstructed JPEGs and exceptions are identical at every thread count. On 16 logical CPUs vs 1 thread: lossless decode 5-8x, VarDCT decode 1.9-3.2x, lossy encode (effort 7) 3.1-4.6x, lossless encode 1.3-4x. Also more SIMD kernels after 0.8.0 (lossy encode effort 7 18% faster single-threaded). See docs/releases/release-0.8.1.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
